{"id":"82c66a91c89d5dee","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-lem-forcing-college.md","title":"Forcing College Lemma","display":"lem-forcing-college — Forcing College Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-forcing-college","aliases":["58-lem-forcing-college"],"display":"lem-forcing-college — Forcing College Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-proper-poset.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-forcing-college"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-forcing-college</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-forcing-college — Forcing College Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bc6a9777ab02e72a\" href=\"?note=bc6a9777ab02e72a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-proper-poset.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-proper-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,R,\\theta,M,p,q,D,r,s\\in V\">\\(P,R,\\theta,M,p,q,D,r,s\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\theta=\\{x:|\\operatorname{tc}(x)|&lt;\\theta\\}\">\\(H_\\theta=\\{x:|\\operatorname{tc}(x)|&lt;\\theta\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{P,R}=\\{\\in,c_P,c_R\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{P,R}=\\{\\in,c_P,c_R\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Compat}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Compat}_R\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_{\\mathcal L_{P,R}}\">\\(\\prec_{\\mathcal L_{P,R}}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperPoset}_S\\)</span> are the notions from the dependencies.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}college}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ProperPoset}_S(P,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\n\\land P,R\\in H_\\theta\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land |M|=\\aleph_0\n\\land\\langle M,\\in\\cap M^2,P,R\\rangle\n\\prec_{\\mathcal L_{P,R}}\n\\langle H_\\theta,\\in\\cap H_\\theta^2,P,R\\rangle\n\\land p\\in M\\cap P\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\n\\exists q\\in P\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\n\\forall D\\in M\\;\n\\bigl[\nD\\subseteq P\n\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\to\n\\forall r\\in P\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\exists s\\in D\\cap M\\;\\operatorname{Compat}_R(r,s)\n\\bigr)\n\\bigr]\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}college}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ProperPoset}_S(P,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\n\\land P,R\\in H_\\theta\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land |M|=\\aleph_0\n\\land\\langle M,\\in\\cap M^2,P,R\\rangle\n\\prec_{\\mathcal L_{P,R}}\n\\langle H_\\theta,\\in\\cap H_\\theta^2,P,R\\rangle\n\\land p\\in M\\cap P\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\n\\exists q\\in P\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\n\\forall D\\in M\\;\n\\bigl[\nD\\subseteq P\n\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\to\n\\forall r\\in P\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\exists s\\in D\\cap M\\;\\operatorname{Compat}_R(r,s)\n\\bigr)\n\\bigr]\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The displayed condition says that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> is an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,P)\">\\((M,P)\\)</span>-generic extension of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Used in proving proper forcing preserves <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-proper-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"bc6a9777ab02e72a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-proper-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"faf104362ffe13b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,R,\\theta,M,p,q,D,r,s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\theta=\\{x:|\\operatorname{tc}(x)|<\\theta\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{P,R}=\\{\\in,c_P,c_R\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Compat}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec_{\\mathcal L_{P,R}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}college}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ProperPoset}_S(P,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\n\\land P,R\\in H_\\theta\\\\\n&{}\\land |M|=\\aleph_0\n\\land\\langle M,\\in\\cap M^2,P,R\\rangle\n\\prec_{\\mathcal L_{P,R}}\n\\langle H_\\theta,\\in\\cap H_\\theta^2,P,R\\rangle\n\\land p\\in M\\cap P\\\\\n&{}\\to\n\\exists q\\in P\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\n\\forall D\\in M\\;\n\\bigl[\nD\\subseteq P\n\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&\\hspace{43mm}\\to\n\\forall r\\in P\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\exists s\\in D\\cap M\\;\\operatorname{Compat}_R(r,s)\n\\bigr)\n\\bigr]\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"(M,P)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false}],"bytes":1503,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3898","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-lem-forcing-college.md|58-lem-forcing-college]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["bc6a9777ab02e72a","0fbfc19800246e77","faf104362ffe13b3"]}